  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> <a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"http://upsssc.gov.in/Default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Uttar Pradesh Subordinate Services Selection Commission (UPSSSC)</a> </span>has released the final result 2026 for selection to the posts of Junior Assistant under the Advt No. 09-Exam/2022. UPSSSC was held typing test examination on 22 November 2025 for the posts of 62 Junior Assistant in various locations of Uttar Pradesh. Candidates who had appeared in this examination can check their UPSSSC Junior Assistant Final Result 2026 from the direct link provided below</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Uttar Pradesh Subordinate Services Selection Commission (UPSSSC)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">UPSSSC Junior Assistant Final Result 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">UPSSSC Junior Assistant 10+2 Advt No. : 09-Exam/2022</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Notification Date : <strong>19 December 2022</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>19 December 2022</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>08 January 2023</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>08 January 2023</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Correction Last Date :&nbsp;<b>15 January 2023</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Exam Date :&nbsp;<b>19 January 2025</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Exam City Available :<b> 10 January 2025</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card : <strong>16 January 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Answer Key Objection : <strong>24-30 January 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Result Available : <strong>02 September 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Typing Test Date :<strong> 22 November 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Typing Test Admit Card : <strong>18 November 2025&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Typing Test Result : <strong>25 February 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Final Result : <strong>21 August 2026</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, EWS, OBC :<strong> Rs. 25/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST, PH :<strong> Rs. 25/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UPSSSC Junior Assistant Notification 2022 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Age Limit As On 01 July 2022</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>21 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>40 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per UPSSSC Junior Assistant Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UPSSSC Junior Assistant 2022 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 62 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 34.8975%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 14.8765%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>General&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 13.0947%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>EWS</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 12.5089%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>OBC</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 12.5733%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>SC</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 12.0493%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>ST</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 34.8975%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Junior Assistant</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 14.8765%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">38</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 13.0947%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">06</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 12.5089%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">09</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 12.5733%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">06</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 12.0493%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">03</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>UPSSSC Junior Assistant Bharti 2022 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">UPSSSC PET 2021 Score Card.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates must have passed class 12th (Intermediate) Exam in Any Recognized Board In India with CCC / Equivalent Exam Passed.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Typing Test :</strong>&nbsp;Hindi 30 WPM</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All candidates must read the official information completely before applying.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UPSSSC Junior Assistant Online Form 2022 : </strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Written Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Typing Test</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Download UPSSSC Junior Assistant Final Result 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Check the Important Links section </span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Then click on the Download Final Result link </span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After clicking on the link, candidates will be redirected to the Dashboard page. </span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">In this page candidates have to fill up the following fields with proper details:</span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Candidate’s Registration Number</strong></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Date of Birth</strong></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Gender</strong></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Verification Code</strong> </span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Then the candidates will be required to submit the details in order to download the final result.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">The candidate can also download it from the official Website. </span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow Our Instagram Channel</st